      "writtenOn": "2026-05-18T11:28:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This hardcodes the env file path unconditionally, replacing the previous {{ barbican_env_file | default(omit) }} logic. When enable_federation is false, the template task in deploy_standalone_run_repo_tests.yaml won\u0027t render this file, so ADDITIONAL_ENV_FILE will point to a non-existent path. This could break existing non-federation jobs (e.g. Barbican standalone scenarios).\n\nSuggestion — make it conditional:\n\nADDITIONAL_ENV_FILE: \"{{ \u0027/tmp/additional_env_file.yaml\u0027 if (enable_federation | default(false) | bool) else (barbican_env_file | default(omit)) }}\"\n\nAlso: typo — \"aditional\" should be \"additional\".",
      "revId": "ff5bc76b39d4b67760d5e3647b96dd3fa6b82f5c",
      "serverId": "270e2033-b340-4cff-9539-693957ebf0e7"
